{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long forgotton craft from the first days of space exploration has been located.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/bfbbc65387703848909676406c797fa4.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/bfbbc65387703848909676406c797fa4.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space craft from the days when robots were robots and space crafts were mostly clock work and electrical items were powered by small sentient cubes that follow you around like puppies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/99504543fac8e2588472336ae641b78c.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/99504543fac8e2588472336ae641b78c.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero of our story is JB, a small robot tasked with recovering flight recorders from lost space craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JB isn't your conventional robot hero, oh no. JB has a fully functioning pair of arms with which they get around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/aa389469b36e4a155380eb26f4c15360.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/aa389469b36e4a155380eb26f4c15360.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to describe here just how different JB is - but I'll give it a go ... in this game you don't just wiggle a joystick to move JB around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well technically you do just wiggle a joystick to move JB around, but it's the actual in world joystick attached to JB themselves that gets wiggled. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To walk around you move your leg joystick around with one of JB's hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JB's other hand is then free to grab items, open doors, push buttons, lift flaps, pull levers etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty is if you need to climb around the environment you can. Use both hands at once to grab and pull JB around in a natural and remarkably intuitive way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/34a9e054662b59b9781b75c5f1fb1d2e.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/34a9e054662b59b9781b75c5f1fb1d2e.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also 251789 ...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733870?t=1769862209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733870?t=1769862209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/644dcd8f532b3e128acf80dcdc927cccd146203a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769862209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/644dcd8f532b3e128acf80dcdc927cccd146203a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769862209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long forgotton craft from the first days of space exploration has been located.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/bfbbc65387703848909676406c797fa4.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/bfbbc65387703848909676406c797fa4.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space craft from the days when robots were robots and space crafts were mostly clock work and electrical items were powered by small sentient cubes that follow you around like puppies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/99504543fac8e2588472336ae641b78c.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/99504543fac8e2588472336ae641b78c.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero of our story is JB, a small robot tasked with recovering flight recorders from lost space craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JB isn't your conventional robot hero, oh no. JB has a fully functioning pair of arms with which they get around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/aa389469b36e4a155380eb26f4c15360.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/aa389469b36e4a155380eb26f4c15360.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to describe here just how different JB is - but I'll give it a go ... in this game you don't just wiggle a joystick to move JB around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well technically you do just wiggle a joystick to move JB around, but it's the actual in world joystick attached to JB themselves that gets wiggled. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To walk around you move your leg joystick around with one of JB's hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JB's other hand is then free to grab items, open doors, push buttons, lift flaps, pull levers etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty is if you need to climb around the environment you can. Use both hands at once to grab and pull JB around in a natural and remarkably intuitive way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/34a9e054662b59b9781b75c5f1fb1d2e.avif?t=1769862209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras_big/34a9e054662b59b9781b75c5f1fb1d2e.webp?t=1769862209 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also 251789 ...</p>","developers":["Squigalug"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/deb6d86e0690d226b46d68dcc12487c28ce80ad2/header.jpg?t=1769862209","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733870/242468157/e7364f3a104478933cbd975298d437e5cdac6375/1750895344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748539946","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733870/242468157/e7364f3a104478933cbd975298d437e5cdac6375/1750895344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748539946","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733870/242468157/e7364f3a104478933cbd975298d437e5cdac6375/1750895344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748539946","